<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id">Haggai</book>
  <para style="h">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc1">Haggai</para>
  <para style="toc2">Haggai</para>
  <para style="mt">Haggai</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpi Darius in kumpi a sep kum ni a cin kum, a hla guhna, a ni masa ni-in kamsang Haggai tungtawnin Judah gam uhpa, Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le siempu lien pa Jehozadak’ tapa Joshua kungah Topa’ thu tam bangin a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Tam mite in Topa’ inn lamkia ding hun nai lo hi, a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua ciengin kamsang Haggai tungah Topa’ thu tungin tam bangin a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tam innpi kisie gawpin a op laitahin inn hoipipi sungah na ten ding hun ma uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ziehin tu-in Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na opdan uh kingaisun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khaici tampi na tu vua, an tawmno khat beh na la uhi; an na neh vangun na gil uh a va ngai sih hi; na dawn vangun na khamin na dawn ngai sih uhi; puonsil ding na nei vangun koima in lum na sa sih uhi; tuale sum thalaw pa in sum-ip tawvang khat sungah a koi dinga a thalaw ahi lel bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Na opdan uh kingaisun pha un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua sungah keima nuomtahin tengin ei kipatawi thei nadingin muol tungah kato-in sing va sui ta unlen, inn lam un, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note in tampitah na lamet vangun halno khat beh a pha hi; tuale innah tuate na tut uh ciengin kang semmang pieh ding hi. Vanglien Topa in bang ding in lah? ci hi. Keima’ inn a kisiet gawp ziehin na inn ciet uh na nawdel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin note tunga vantungte in daitui kangsah a, leitang in ga gasah lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in gam le muolte tung, ankung tung, lenggazu tha tung, sathau tung, leitang pana a piengte tung, mihing ganhing le amau’ nasepna zosie tungah guotui ka kangsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin Sheatiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le siempu lien pa Jehozadak’ tapa Joshua in mi a omlai teng zosie tawh Topa a Pasien uh’ thugente le Topa a Pasien uh’ sawl ahi kamsang Haggai’ thugente a mang uhi; tuale mipite in Topa a giing uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa’ kamtai Haggai in mite tungah Topa’ thugente gen a, note kang ompi hi, Topa in ci hi, ci-in a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in Sheatiel’ tapa Zerubbabel’ lungsim, Judah gam uhpa’ lungsim, siempu lien pa Jehozadak’ tapa Joshua’ lungsim le mi a omlai teng’ lungsim a thosah hi; tuale amate pei-in Vanglien Topa a Pasien uh’ inn ah na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khum ni pen Kumpi Darius in kumpi a sep zaw a kum nina kum, a hla guhna a ni sawmni le ni li ni ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />a hla sagina, a ni sawmni le khat ni-in Haggai tungtawnin Topa’ thu tam bangin tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah gam a uhpa Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel le siempu lien pa Jehozadak’ tapa Joshua, le mi a omlai teng tu-in hopi in. Note lahah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nidang lai-a tam biehinnpi a minthanna a mu kha ngai koi teng na omlai vuoi mah? Tu-in tami bangci na sa vuoi? Na muna vuah bangma lo bang ta hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hizongle Jerubbabel aw, tu-in kihangsah in, Topa in ci hi; siempu lien pa Jehozadak’ tapa Joshua aw, hangsan in; no gamsung mipi zosie aw, kihangsah un, Topa in ci hi; note kang ompi ziehin na sem un, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gam panin nang pei lai-un note kang thuciem dung zui-in note lahah ka hlagau a teng hi; zau sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi: Keima in a sawt loin vanpi leipi, tuipi, le leigawte ka lawhthing kia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minam zosie’ gou teng ang tun thei nadingin keima in minam zosie ka lawhthing ding a, minthanna tawh tami biehinn a kidim ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngun le kham keima-a’ ahi hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kilam nukhia inn pen a kilam masa sangin thupizaw ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi; keima tami munah note cithei nopsahna kang pie ding hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpi Darius a kumpi sep a kum nina, a hla sagi na, a ni sawmni le khat ni-in kamsang Haggai tung panin Topa’ thu tung a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vanglien Topa in tam bangin ci hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat in a puon kihlip kawmah sa siengtho puo hinlen, tua puon kihlip tawh anlum khat popo ahi a, zu ahi a, a kihuon an khat popo ahi zongin a thamkhah leh, tua khu an siengtho suoh thei ding amah? Siempupa in, “An siengtho suoh thei lo ding hi,” ci-in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin Haggai in, “Misi luong khat a suhkhah ziehin a sieng lo mi khat in tamte khat popo a suhkhah leh, tua a suhkhahte a bua a suoh diei mah?” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Haggai in, keima mai-ah tam minam le tam gam tua tawh kibang hi, Topa in ci hi; tuale a khut utawh a sep zosie uzong tua bang hi ding hi; tua sunga a piehte uh a bua hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin tami ni-a kipanin bang ang tung diei, ci tu-in ngaisun un. Topa’ biehinnpi sungah suong khat tungah suong khat a kikoi masangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />na omdan kingaisun un. An tena sawmni a opna munah mi khat a pei ciengin tena sawmkhat beh a na pha hi; lenggazu tena beelpi sawmnga a opna ah mi khat a pei ciengin tena sawmni beh a na pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Huisapi, maaibuoh natna, le gielpi tawh note kang vatmai vangin keima lamah note nang kihei sih uhi, Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A hla kuona, a ni sawmni le lini ahi, tuni-a kipanin ngaisun un. Khum ni khu Topa’ biehinn khuombul a kiphu ni ahi ziehin ngaisun un:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ansal sungah anci a kinuasie lai ei mah? Lenggui, theikung, mang kawlsing, le olive kungte khat beh a ga nai sih amah? Keima in tu ni-a kipanin note thupha kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuami hla ni sawmni le ni li ni-in Haggai tungah tam bangin Topa’ thu a niveina a tung hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Judah gam uhpa Zerubbabel hopi-inlen ama kungah gen in, keima in vanpi le leipi thingkhe-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />kumpi gamte’ mang tophate ka khuleh ding a, namcin kumpi gamte’ hatna susie-in a sakol leengte le a hawlte ka khuleh ding hi; sakolte le a hawlte koipo a guolpa’ namsau tawh a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khumi ni-in Vanglien Topa in a cina-ah, ka nasempa Shealtiel’ tapa Zerubbabel aw, nangma kang la ding hi, Topa in ci hi. Tuale seal tupna khutsip bangin kang bawl ding hi; azieh pen keima in nangma kang teel zo hi, Vanglien Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
</usx>
